# Used when building content/Dockerfile from the repository root (BuildKit
# reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Send only content/, schemas/ and web/ —
# web/ without its installs and builds, which the image's Node stage makes.
*
!content
!schemas
!web
content/**/__pycache__
content/**/*.pyc
content/db.sqlite3
content/media
content/var
content/.venv
content/static
content/.test-media
content/.env
web/**/node_modules
web/**/dist
